edit's highlight and injection queries are its own, written after the
queries that gotreesitter (https://github.com/odvcencio/gotreesitter, MIT)
bundles for each grammar, which come from these projects:

  go                github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-go                 MIT
  gomod             github.com/camdencheek/tree-sitter-go-mod             MIT
  yaml              github.com/tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-yaml      MIT
  json              github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-json               MIT
  markdown          github.com/tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-markdown  MIT
  markdown_inline     and github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter      Apache-2.0
  bash              github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-bash               MIT
  make              github.com/tree-sitter-grammars/tree-sitter-make      MIT
                      and github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter      Apache-2.0
  javascript        github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-javascript         MIT
  python            github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-python             MIT
  java              github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-java               MIT

The grammars, which gotreesitter embeds, come from the same repositories
under the same licenses; gotreesitter's THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES lists them.
